From 89e4ce8c09b7bb6b98625f8011956aa6532eb3aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: virtualAxe <virtualaxe@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 12:37:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 09/13] virtual: share canonical header material

Why: define one canonical block-header material path shared by software
validation and virtual mining.
Virtual-only: the shared helper is used by virtual ASIC search while preserving
the upstream submit-time validator.
Upstream surface: mining header helpers, virtual ASIC cache setup, and mining
unit tests.
Verify: run verify-test-ci and make verify-submit-replay.
Removal impact: guest search and validator can diverge on header construction.
